{"id": "EUVD-2026-91465", "enisaUuid": "0369b3f1-6a8c-3881-ba7a-ea71ed5898fa", "description": "YesWiki before 4.6.7 contains an algorithmic-complexity denial of service in the wakka.php formatter due to an O(n^2) markdown-link regex. Unauthenticated attackers can submit a small crafted body of bracket characters to the page-edit preview endpoint to pin PHP-FPM workers and saturate the pool.", "datePublished": "2026-10-02T11:38:25", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-02T14:50:11", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/YesWiki/yeswiki/security/advisories/GHSA-gf57-wg5m-h34q", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/yeswiki-before-4.6.7-redos-via-wakka-php-edit-preview-endpoint"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-104454", "GHSA-j46p-q3g4-r6r6"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.4, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "18bf77e4-929b-3dc9-989c-503a226810dd", "product": {"name": "yeswiki", "vendor": {"name": "YesWiki"}}, "product_version": "0 <4.6.7"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "45736031-03f6-3951-a278-8bb5fa8865f6", "vendor": {"name": "YesWiki"}}], "isExploited": false}